n determining the association between myocardial\ninfarction and oral contraceptive usage. Findings were then extrapolated\nFe the hospital admissions for the general population of the country\n\u2018the U.K.).\n\n_ Some of the most important statements made by the authors are reviewed\njn the attached table together with an evaluation of whether each state-\not ment was an observed fact or a judgment, whether it was supported in the\narticle or elsewhere, whether it had been accounted for in the analysis\nand the associated problows which appear to-be unresolved.\n\n\u00a5\n'\n69668S\u00a30", "words": [{"text": "-", "x0": 10, "y0": 37, "x1": 30, "y1": 54, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": ":", "x0": 540, "y0": 38, "x1": 542, "y1": 41, "conf": 26.0}, {"text": "ore", "x0": 622, "y0": 32, "x1": 701, "y1": 42, "conf": 4.0}, {"text": "-", "x0": 695, "y0": 23, "x1": 705, "y1": 51, "conf": 32.0}, {"text": "MEMORANDUM.", "x0": 13, "y0": 55, "x1": 241, "y1": 76, "conf": 73.0}, {"text": "RTMENT", "x0": 341, "y0": 55, "x1": 400, "y1": 65, "conf": 47.0}, {"text": "OF", "x0": 407, "y0": 55, "x1": 426, "y1": 64, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "HEALTH,", "x0": 434, "y0": 55, "x1": 495, "y1": 66, "conf": 47.0}, {"text": "QU", "x0": 516, "y0": 55, "x1": 531, "y1": 64, "conf": 5.0}, {"text": "CATION,", "x0": 533, "y0": 54, "x1": 592, "y1": 66, "conf": 5.0}, {"text": "AND", "x0": 599, "y0": 54, "x1": 628, "y1": 64, "conf": 75.0}, {"text": "WLLFARL", "x0": 636, "y0": 54, "x1": 698, "y1": 63, "conf": 43.0}, {"text": "PURTIG", "x0": 425, "y0": 74, "x1": 464, "y1": 82, "conf": 0.0}, {"text": "HE", "x0": 477, "y0": 63, "x1": 491, "y1": 91, "conf": 26.0}, {"text": "METH", "x0": 494, "y0": 74, "x1": 523, "y1": 82, "conf": 50.0}, {"text": "Sag", "x0": 531, "y0": 74, "x1": 558, "y1": 82, "conf": 22.0}, {"text": "FOOD", "x0": 392, "y0": 92, "x1": 425, "y1": 100, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "AND", "x0": 432, "y0": 92, "x1": 457, "y1": 100, "conf": 71.0}, {"text": "DRUG", "x0": 464, "y0": 92, "x1": 498, "y1": 100, "c